1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:03,220
(Sheldon:)I'm sensing things
have gotten awkward.

2
00:00:03,283 --> 00:00:05,623
(Amy:)No. It's okay.

3
00:00:05,686 --> 00:00:08,956
(Amy:)If we're friends, we should be
able to talk about anything.

4
00:00:09,022 --> 00:00:10,852
(Sheldon:)All right.

5
00:00:10,924 --> 00:00:14,964
(Amy:)So, you had some questions
about me seeing other people.

6
00:00:15,028 --> 00:00:16,828
(Sheldon:)Just a few.

7
00:00:16,897 --> 00:00:18,627
(Amy:)Go ahead.

8
00:00:18,699 --> 00:00:20,629
(Sheldon:)How many dates have you been on?

9
00:00:20,701 --> 00:00:22,631
(Sheldon:)Who were they with?
Where'd you go?

10
00:00:22,703 --> 00:00:25,103
(Sheldon:)Where did you meet them?
Did you sleep with them?

11
00:00:25,172 --> 00:00:26,972
(Sheldon:)And how much longer
to the aquarium?

12
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,380
(Sheldon:)I'm getting kind of hungry.

13
00:00:29,443 --> 00:00:31,773
(Sheldon:)Let's see.

14
00:00:31,845 --> 00:00:35,645
(Amy:)I have been on six dates
with three different people.

15
00:00:35,716 --> 00:00:38,486
(Amy:)It was either for
coffee or dinner.

16
00:00:38,552 --> 00:00:41,992
(Amy:)One I met at a bookstore
and two I met online.

17
00:00:42,055 --> 00:00:43,785
(Amy:)I haven't slept with anyone.

18
00:00:43,857 --> 00:00:45,527
(Amy:)The aquarium is
40 minutes away.

19
00:00:45,592 --> 00:00:47,362
(Amy:)And there's a baggie of Cheerios
for you

20
00:00:47,427 --> 00:00:48,697
(Amy:)in the glove compartment.

21
00:00:48,762 --> 00:00:52,032
Uh, regular or honey nut?

22
00:00:52,099 --> 00:00:54,369
(Amy:)I mixed them.

